# Project 2 : Information Security Register 
## Medicare Connect (PTY) Ltd
### ISO 27001 Risk Assessment | Healthcare sector | South Africa


## The Business Problem 
Project 1 identified 12 control gaps. Management had limited budget and needed to know which gaps to fix first.

This project quantifies each threat in business terms so Management can allocate spend based on evidence, not opinion.

