## Methodology
- ISO/IEC 27005:2022 Risk Management
- ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Clause 6.1.2
- ISO 31000 Risk Management Principles
- 5x5 Likelihood x Impact matrix
- Inherent and residual risk scoring

## Compliance Mapping
Every risk is mapped to:
- ISO 27001:2022 Annex A control
- Specific POPIA section violated

## South African Context
This register includes risks specific to the South African operating environment that generic templates omit:

- Load shedding impact on clinical systems
- POPIA 72 hour breach notification failure
- Information Officer registration under
  POPIA Section 55
- National Health Act retention conflict with POPIA minimization requirements
- Business email compromise targeting SA payment systems
